          "_name": "video03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"video03\" group=\"Image & Video\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" plugins=\"PlayerVimeo\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"videoWidth\" title=\"Video\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n    </fieldset>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div mbr-video class=\"mbr-figure col-12 mb-5 col-md-{{videoWidth}}\">\n        <iframe src=\"https://youtu.be/52lKkBMS5oA?loop=1&autoplay=1\"></iframe>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 content-text\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Year after year, we cultivate change</b></h5>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Let us tell you the story of L’Occitane through the journey of a year…<br><br>Each year, we plant ingredient crops that are designed to live in harmony with their surrounding ecosystems. We rely on the gifts of Mother Earth and marvel at nature’s power as the plants bloom and bear fruit.<br><br>We explore the treasures hidden within these natural crops and dedicate ourselves to scientific research until we achieve breakthrough innovations. These discoveries are then transformed into delightful experiences.<br><br>We work closely with local producers because we believe that every action—no matter how big or small—has the power to make a difference.</p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Download now</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
